YOUR TASK: Complete this task: Implement the exact baseline parity-exchange algorithm: compute b_i=max(X_i,Y_i,Z_i) and a base color attaining it, sort by b descending, take first 2K as selected T and rest U, baseline sum B and parity mask m; if m=0 output B; otherwise precompute top 5 candidates for each selected recolor role (base a to color c), selected swap-out role (base a), and unselected target role (color c), then evaluate all plans of one operation with mask m or two operations with the other two nonzero masks by brute-forcing distinct assignments of item ids to the <=4 roles and taking B - minimum loss.